## Recall & Graph Commands

```bash
# Recall (session memory, decisions, synthesized knowledge, code symbols)
ai-brains recall "GPU driver fix" --limit 5                      # FTS5 keyword
ai-brains recall "auth flow" --semantic --limit 5               # semantic
